WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.266
MOBIUS
Loki, you're in a lot of trouble.

00:00:03.266 --> 00:00:04.505
LOKI
What do you want from me?

00:00:05.657 --> 00:00:07.049
MOBIUS
Come on, sit down.

00:00:08.266 --> 00:00:10.266
Our timeline is in chaos.

00:00:11.313 --> 00:00:13.381
LOKI
And you need the God of Mischief to help.

00:00:13.381 --> 00:00:15.123
JUDGE RENSLAYER
Loki is unpredictable.

00:00:15.123 --> 00:00:16.190
LOKI
[Laughing]

00:00:17.154 --> 00:00:18.602
LOKI
I know what I am.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.028
Good.

00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:21.855
Bad.

00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:26.026
Bit of both.

